ner noreferrer" title="Bloomberg" aria-label="Bloomberg" class="text-[#dfdff2]/80 opacity-75 transition-opacity duration-300 hover:opacity-100"><img src="/img/press/bloomberg.svg" alt="Bloomberg" class="w-auto relative top-[2px] h-[16px] sm:h-[19px]"/></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="relative w-full overflow-x-clip bg-[#0e0e0e]"><div class="pb-20 pt-20 sm:pb-28 sm:pt-28 lg:pb-32 lg:pt-32"><div class=""><div class="feature-track" style="--points:3"><div class="feature-hold"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1600px] grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 sm:py-20 lg:px-14 lg:py-24 2xl:max-w-[1800px] 2xl:gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,42%)_minmax(0,58%)]"><div class="pl-4 sm:pl-8 lg:pl-12"><div class="mb-12"><span class="feature-rise inline-block bg-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 font-geistmono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#e8e8ea] sm:text-[11px]">The terminal</span><h2 class="feature-rise mt-6 font-swissnow text-3xl font-light leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-[#e8e8ea] sm:text-4xl">Every market, one desk</h2><p class="feature-rise mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65 sm:text-base">Kairos connects the venues, the data and the execution into a single terminal — so the work that used to take four tabs and a spreadsheet happens in one place.</p></div><h3 class="font-swissnow text-2xl font-light leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[#e8e8ea] sm:text-3xl"><span class="sr-only">Sub-second data &amp; latency</span><span aria-hidden="true"><span class="hero-word"><span class="hero-char">S</span><span class="hero-char">u</span><span class="hero-char">b</span><span class="hero-char">-</span><span class="hero-char">s</span><span class="hero-char">e</span><span class="hero-char">c</span><span class="hero-char">o</span><span class="hero-char">n</span><span class="hero-char">d</span></span> <span class="hero-word"><span class="hero-char">d</span><span class="hero-char">a</span><span class="hero-char">t</span><span class="hero-char">a</span></span> <span class="hero-word"><span class="hero-char">&amp;</span></span> <span class="hero-word"><span class="hero-char">l</span><span class="hero-char">a</span><span class="hero-char">t</span><span class="hero-char">e</span><span class="hero-char">n</span><span class="hero-char">c</span><span class="hero-char">y</span></span></span></h3><p class="feature-rise mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65 sm:text-base">Quotes, fills and news land in the terminal as they happen. No polling loop, no refresh, no waiting on a venue&#x27;s own dashboard to catch up.</p><div class="feature-rise mt-10 max-w-md border-t border-white/10"><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="latency-point-0" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-[#e8e8ea]">Streaming order books</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80 rotate-45"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="latency-point-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[1fr] opacity-100"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Every venue&#x27;s book arrives over one socket and is merged in the browser. There is no polling interval to fall behind.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="latency-point-1" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-white/65 group-hover:text-white/95">Colocated ingest</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="latency-point-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Feeds are consumed next to the venues themselves, so the terminal sees a print before a refresh would have fired.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="latency-point-2" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-white/65 group-hover:text-white/95">Execution round trip</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="latency-point-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Orders leave the terminal and reach the venue in tens of milliseconds, measured end to end rather than at the edge.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[560px] px-4 sm:px-10 lg:max-w-none lg:px-6 hidden sm:block"><div class="feature-rise"><div class="relative"><style>
.kairos-desk .ob-num,
.kairos-desk .tabular-nums {
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums;
  font-feature-settings: 'calt' off;
  font-variant-ligatures: no-contextual;
}
.kairos-desk { font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; }
</style><div aria-hidden="true" class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg" style="box-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14), 0 28px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)"><div class="relative flex items-center px-4" style="height:40px;background:#0b0b0c;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)"><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-block rounded-full" style="width:11px;height:11px;background:#d9665f"></span><span class="inline-block rounded-full" style="width:11px;height:11px;background:#d9a84e"></span><span class="inline-block rounded-full" style="width:11px;height:11px;background:#63b267"></span></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[12px] font-normal" style="color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45)">Kairos</span></div><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:1840 / 1060"><div class="kairos-desk absolute left-0 top-0 origin-top-left transition-opacity duration-500" style="--terminal-bg:#0b0b0c;--terminal-gutter:#0d0d0e;--bg-deepest:#0b0b0d;--bg-surface:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);--bg-panel:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);--bg-elevated:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);--positions-row-hover:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);--search-bg:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);--text-primary:#e9e9ec;--text-secondary:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.62);--text-muted:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.44);--text-dim:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);--text-label:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.34);--panel-outline:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.075);--border-component:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);--border-subtle:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);--chart-grid:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);--accent:#e9e9ec;--accent-light:#e9e9ec;--accent-alpha-10:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);--accent-alpha-15:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);--accent-alpha-30:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.30);--green:#63a17e;--red:#a9615c;--chart-candle-up:#6aa884;--chart-candle-down:#a56b66;--green-fill-soft:rgba(99, 161, 126, 0.12);--green-fill-light:rgba(99, 161, 126, 0.08);--green-fill-max:rgba(99, 161, 126, 0.20);--red-fill-soft:rgba(169, 97, 92, 0.10);--red-fill-light:rgba(169, 97, 92, 0.06);--red-fill-max:rgba(169, 97, 92, 0.16);--outcome-yes-fill:rgba(99, 161, 126, 0.16);--outcome-no-fill:rgba(169, 97, 92, 0.14);--buy-button-bg:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);--alpha-3:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);--alpha-4:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);--alpha-6:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);--alpha-8:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);--alpha-12:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);--alpha-15:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);--alpha-20:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.20);--alpha-30:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.30);width:1840px;height:1060px;transform:scale(0.5);opacity:0;background-color:var(--terminal-gutter)"><div class="flex h-full gap-px p-px"><div class="min-w-0" style="flex:0 0 220px"><div class="h-full w-full flex flex-col" style="background-color:var(--terminal-bg);border:1px solid var(--panel-outline)"><div class="relative flex-shrink-0 flex items-center px-1 gap-1" style="height:32px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--alpha-6)"><div class="px-2 py-1 text-[10px] ob-num shrink-0" style="color:var(--text-dim)"> EST</div><div class="flex-1"></div><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded" style="width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--text-dim);background:var(--alpha-4)"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded" style="width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--text-dim);background:var(--alpha-4)"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 3 4 7l4 4M4 7h16M16 21l4-4-4-4M20 17H4"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded" style="width:20px;height:20px;color:var(--text-dim);background:var(--alpha-4)"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-l