te right-2.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[9px] ob-num pointer-events-none" style="color:var(--text-dim)">Shares</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><div class="relative flex-1 flex items-center rounded-md overflow-hidden" style="height:28px;background:var(--search-bg)"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0" style="width:59%;background:var(--alpha-8)"></div><span class="absolute inset-y-1.5 w-px" style="left:25%;background:var(--alpha-12)"></span><span class="absolute inset-y-1.5 w-px" style="left:50%;background:var(--alpha-12)"></span><span class="absolute inset-y-1.5 w-px" style="left:75%;background:var(--alpha-12)"></span><span class="absolute inset-y-1 w-0.5 rounded" style="left:59%;background:var(--text-primary)"></span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-md ob-num text-[11px]" style="width:44px;height:28px;background:var(--search-bg);color:var(--text-secondary)">59%</div></div><label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-secondary)"><span class="inline-block rounded-[3px]" style="width:13px;height:13px;border:1px solid var(--border-component)"></span>Take Profit / Stop Loss</label><div class="text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-secondary)">Fill and Kill</div><div class="flex gap-1.5"><div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-between rounded-md px-2.5" style="height:30px;background:var(--search-bg)"><span class="text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-muted)">Max Slip</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[10px] leading-none" style="width:16px;height:16px;background:var(--alpha-6);color:var(--text-muted)">−</span><span class="ob-num text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-primary)">3<span style="color:var(--text-dim)">¢</span></span><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[10px] leading-none" style="width:16px;height:16px;background:var(--alpha-6);color:var(--text-muted)">+</span></span></div><div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-between rounded-md px-2.5" style="height:30px;background:var(--search-bg)"><span class="text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-muted)">Retries</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[10px] leading-none" style="width:16px;height:16px;background:var(--alpha-6);color:var(--text-muted)">−</span><span class="ob-num text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-primary)">3</span><span class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-[10px] leading-none" style="width:16px;height:16px;background:var(--alpha-6);color:var(--text-muted)">+</span></span></div></div><div class="mt-auto flex flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-[12px]" style="color:var(--text-secondary)">Cost</span><span class="ob-num text-[12px] font-medium" style="color:var(--text-primary)">$<!-- -->1,750.00</span></div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between pl-2"><span class="text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-dim)">Positional Value<!-- -->:</span><span class="ob-num text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-muted)">$1,750.00</span></div><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between pl-2"><span class="text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-dim)">Platform Fee<!-- -->:</span><span class="ob-num text-[11px]" style="color:var(--text-muted)">$0.00</span></div></div><div class="w-full font-normal px-3 py-2 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md" style="min-height:38px;font-size:13px;background:var(--buy-button-bg);color:#0b0b0c"><span class="font-normal tracking-wide">Buy</span><span style="opacity:0.35">•</span><span class="ob-num text-[13px]">$<!-- -->1,750.00</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t border-white/10"><div class="feature-track" style="--points:4"><div class="feature-hold"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1600px] grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 sm:py-20 lg:px-14 lg:py-24 2xl:max-w-[1800px] 2xl:gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,58%)_minmax(0,42%)]"><div class="pl-4 sm:pl-8 lg:pl-12 lg:order-2"><h3 class="font-swissnow text-2xl font-light leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[#e8e8ea] sm:text-3xl"><span class="sr-only">Institutional-grade API</span><span aria-hidden="true"><span class="hero-word"><span class="hero-char">I</span><span class="hero-char">n</span><span class="hero-char">s</span><span class="hero-char">t</span><span class="hero-char">i</span><span class="hero-char">t</span><span class="hero-char">u</span><span class="hero-char">t</span><span class="hero-char">i</span><span class="hero-char">o</span><span class="hero-char">n</span><span class="hero-char">a</span><span class="hero-char">l</span><span class="hero-char">-</span><span class="hero-char">g</span><span class="hero-char">r</span><span class="hero-char">a</span><span class="hero-char">d</span><span class="hero-char">e</span></span> <span class="hero-word"><span class="hero-char">A</span><span class="hero-char">P</span><span class="hero-char">I</span></span></span></h3><p class="feature-rise mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65 sm:text-base">The same data and execution the terminal runs on, exposed directly. REST and WebSocket, documented, with the aggregation already done.</p><div class="feature-rise mt-10 max-w-md border-t border-white/10"><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="api-point-0" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-[#e8e8ea]">REST and WebSocket</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80 rotate-45"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="api-point-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[1fr] opacity-100"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Snapshot what you need on request, stream what you need continuously, over documented endpoints.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="api-point-1" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-white/65 group-hover:text-white/95">Aggregated endpoints</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="api-point-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">The cross-venue view is what you call — one integration instead of one per platform.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="api-point-2" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-white/65 group-hover:text-white/95">National best bid, best offer (NBBO)</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="api-point-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Kairos finds the best bid and best offer for a trade in prediction markets by merging every venue&#x27;s book into a single ladder, then quoting the top of it. No one exchange holds both sides of the touch, so the composite spread is tighter than any venue&#x27;s own — and an order sent to the NBBO endpoint routes to whichever venue is actually showing that price.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="api-point-3" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-white/65 group-hover:text-white/95">Keys and limits</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="api-point-3" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Scoped keys, published rate limits and a sandbox to build against before you go live.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[560px] px-4 sm:px-10 lg:max-w-none lg:px-6 lg:order-1"><div class="feature-rise"><div class="relative"><div aria-hidden="true" class="relative w-full"><div class="relative w-full" style="aspect-ratio:1840 / 1