n class="hero-char">r</span><span class="hero-char">e</span><span class="hero-char">g</span><span class="hero-char">a</span><span class="hero-char">t</span><span class="hero-char">i</span><span class="hero-char">o</span><span class="hero-char">n</span></span></span></h3><p class="feature-rise mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65 sm:text-base">The same contract from every venue, stacked in one column. One price ladder across the whole ecosystem instead of four tabs and a spreadsheet.</p><div class="feature-rise mt-10 max-w-md border-t border-white/10"><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="aggregation-point-0" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-[#e8e8ea]">One contract, every venue</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80 rotate-45"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="aggregation-point-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[1fr] opacity-100"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Matching markets are resolved across platforms and presented as a single instrument, not four near-duplicates.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="aggregation-point-1" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-white/65 group-hover:text-white/95">Composite top of book</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="aggregation-point-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">The best bid and offer across the ecosystem, so you can see which venue is actually cheapest before you send.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="aggregation-point-2" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-white/65 group-hover:text-white/95">Normalised pricing</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="aggregation-point-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Cents, probabilities and share counts reconciled to one convention across venues that each do it differently.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[560px] px-4 sm:px-10 lg:max-w-none lg:px-6 hidden sm:block"><div class="feature-rise"><div class="relative"><div aria-hidden="true" class="relative w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg" style="aspect-ratio:1680 / 790;border-radius:0"><