d"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1600px] grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 sm:py-20 lg:px-14 lg:py-24 2xl:max-w-[1800px] 2xl:gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,42%)_minmax(0,58%)]"><div class="pl-4 sm:pl-8 lg:pl-12"><h3 class="font-swissnow text-2xl font-light leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-[#e8e8ea] sm:text-3xl"><span class="sr-only">Full customizability</span><span aria-hidden="true"><span class="hero-word"><span class="hero-char">F</span><span class="hero-char">u</span><span class="hero-char">l</span><span class="hero-char">l</span></span> <span class="hero-word"><span class="hero-char">c</span><span class="hero-char">u</span><span class="hero-char">s</span><span class="hero-char">t</span><span class="hero-char">o</span><span class="hero-char">m</span><span class="hero-char">i</span><span class="hero-char">z</span><span class="hero-char">a</span><span class="hero-char">b</span><span class="hero-char">i</span><span class="hero-char">l</span><span class="hero-char">i</span><span class="hero-char">t</span><span class="hero-char">y</span></span></span></h3><p class="feature-rise mt-4 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65 sm:text-base">Every panel moves, resizes and persists. Build the desk you actually trade from, then keep it across sessions and machines.</p><div class="feature-rise mt-10 max-w-md border-t border-white/10"><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="custom-point-0" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-[#e8e8ea]">Draggable panels</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80 rotate-45"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="custom-point-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[1fr] opacity-100"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Move, resize, tear off and stack every panel until the workspace matches how you actually trade.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="custom-point-1" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-white/65 group-hover:text-white/95">Saved layouts</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="custom-point-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Named workspaces stored against your account, so the desk follows you to any machine.</p></div></div></div><div class="border-b border-white/10"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="custom-point-2" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 py-4 text-left"><span class="text-sm transition-colors duration-300 sm:text-base text-white/65 group-hover:text-white/95">Hotkeys</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative size-3.5 shrink-0 text-white/50 transition-transform duration-300 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] group-hover:text-white/80"><span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2 bg-current"></span><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-0 h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-current"></span></span></button><div id="custom-point-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="pb-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">Bind sizing, venue and side to the keys you already use, and keep your hands off the mouse.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[560px] px-4 sm:px-10 lg:max-w-none lg:px-6 hidden sm:block"><div class="feature-rise"><div class="relative"><style>
